%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8457553d7570b1146a94bd661e6d7528, type: 3}
  m_Name: Prepare for Impact Mission
  missionName: Prepare for Impact
  description: "If the asteroid cannot be stopped, then collapse must be limited before the blast arrives. Preserve at least 80% of the threatened region's starting infrastructure through impact and keep the civilization functional after the strike."
  splashImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cbb910250e1a15c418b06ea0b725c841, type: 3}
  victorySplashImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8b4e85836d3b641408deac4ce6f75883, type: 3}
  failureSplashImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5c94911f9fc8cb9409ff6f84b0f55afd, type: 3}
  flavorText: "Not every crisis can be defeated outright. This one demands disciplined triage: reinforce what can be saved, relocate what cannot, and keep critical systems from failing all at once when the shock arrives. Roads, storage sites, hospitals, waterworks, and command centers must be hardened in the right order, not merely repaired after each warning. Citizens may call the preparations grim, but realism is a form of compassion when false hope wastes time. We will not prevent impact, but we can prevent impact from becoming civilizational collapse."
  victoryFlavorText: "The asteroid struck, but the region did not disintegrate. Hardened infrastructure absorbed damage that would have become cascading failure, and emergency systems remained online when they were needed most. Losses were severe, yet survivable, because preparation converted chaos into response. The people inherit ruins, but also a functioning state capable of rebuilding them."
  failureFlavorText: "Impact arrived before preparation reached the required depth. Key infrastructure failed together, transport routes collapsed, and emergency coordination fragmented when it was most needed. The strike became more than a natural disaster because the systems meant to absorb it did not hold. Recovery begins from a far weaker position than it should have."
  participantRole: 0
  strategyTags: 48
  objectives:
  - objectiveName: Prepare for Impact
    description: Preserve at least 80% of the threatened region's starting infrastructure through impact.
    type: 33
    targetValue: 80
    targetMode: 0
    targetMultiplier: 1
    minimumTarget: 0
    maximumTarget: 0
    completionTiming: 1
  constraints: []
  rewardTiers:
  - tierName: Complete
    requiredObjectivesCompleted: 1
    rewardLegacy: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5db9ea6485c4f1694b73bbbcdbe54ce, type: 2}
